- [ ] X-Tenant-ID header only accepted with verified JWT or in dev mode
- [ ] Stripe webhook works without tenant auth (moved to root mux)
- [ ] `/healthz` returns 503 when ClickHouse unreachable
- [ ] `fakeStorage` implements `Ping` — all existing tests pass
- [ ] CSV export uses fetch+blob in dashboard (no raw URL)
